Granite model chain:

The Granite backend, the default recognizer, loads one artifact,
`granite-speech-5.0-470m-turboctc-Q8_0.gguf`, of
`vladers/granite-speech-5.0-470m-turboctc-GGUF` at revision
`bd7db273aa69a26fc81e370c84597fa738fe2ad0`. It is downloaded and cached at runtime on first use;
it is not bundled with the app or committed to this repository.

That artifact is a conversion of IBM's Granite Speech 5.0 470M TurboCTC checkpoint,
`ibm-granite/granite-speech-5.0-470m-turboctc` at revision
